-- session.talk excerpts, rewritten against the damocles Library (ADR 0020).
-- Only the parts that change are shown. See prototype/example-hosts for the
-- whole Script.

use epilogue, sayAll from damocles
-- A local `on epilogue` would now be a load error: it clashes with the import.

script variable spent = []

-- V.I.P. LIMO key, resident slot 183 → trigger $02, arming $80 (discard while busy)
on taken item where the id of item is "object-slot-183", dropping
  if "trigger-02" is in spent then exit taken
  put "trigger-02" after spent
  sayAll ["script2-inline-1", "script2-inline-2", "script2-inline-3"] and wait
  wait 4 s                       -- 200 frames at 50 Hz, game Clock
  epilogue and wait
end taken

-- Every Body without a Script of its own climbs to here.
on landed body
  put "landing-" & the id of body into trigger
  if trigger is in spent then exit landed
  put trigger after spent
  ask dice to draw
  if it >= 40960 then exit landed
  wait 2 s
  sayAll the landingLines of body and wait
  epilogue and wait
end landed

-- An imported Handler is never a message entry point. If the Host delivered
-- `epilogue` to the session object, it would NOT run damocles's epilogue.
-- It would climb past this Script and be reported as unhandled.
